# Brute Force Complexity

## Time Complexity

One shift

* Save last column → **O(m)**
* Shift rows → **O(m × n)**
* Move first column → **O(m)**

Overall

```
O(m + m×n + m)

= O(m×n)
```

Since we do this **k** times,

```
Time = O(k × m × n)
```

---

## Space Complexity

Extra array

```
last_col

Size = m
```

Therefore,

```
Space = O(m)
```

